stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Requirements: task arrives
  Requirements --> Requirements: ledger rejects a requirement it cannot find word for word in the task, or a number in the task that no requirement covers
  Requirements --> Design: ledger accepted
  Design --> Declare: solution written, exposes its items
  Declare --> Declare: engine rejects an exemption with no quoted source
  Declare --> Evaluate: checks declared as data
  Evaluate --> Fix: violations, kinds of item no check covers, or checks that cannot fail
  Fix --> Evaluate: design changed, evaluate again
  Evaluate --> Finish: every requirement checked, every check able to fail, no violation
  Finish --> [*]: final message written from the ledger
